  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ukwati wa Samsoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samsoni anapita ku Timna ndipo kumeneko anaonako mtsikana wa Chifilisiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atabwerera kwawo, anawuza abambo ndi amayi ake kuti, \"Ine ndaona mtsikana wa Chifilisiti ku Timna, tsono mukanditengere ameneyo kuti akhale mkazi wanga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma abambo ndi amayi ake anayankha kuti, \"Kodi palibe mkazi pakati pa abale akowa kapena pakati pa anthu a mtundu wako, kuti iwe upite kukapeza mkazi kwa Afilisti anthu osachita mdulidwe?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JDG 14:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koma Samsoni anawuza abambo ake kuti, \"Kanditengereni ameneyu basi, pakuti ndamukonda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Abambo ndi amayi ake sankadziwa kuti zimenezi zinali zochokera kwa Yehova, pakuti Yehova amafuna powapezera chifukwa Afilistiwo. Nthawi imeneyo nʼkuti Afilisti akulamulira Aisraeli).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choncho Samsoni pamodzi ndi abambo ake anapita ku Timna. Akuyandikira minda ya mpesa ya ku Timna, mwadzidzidzi anamva kubuma kwa mkango waungʼono ukubwera kumene kunali iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono Mzimu wa Yehova unafika ndi mphamvu pa Samsoni ndipo ngakhale analibe chida mʼmanja mwake, iye anakadzula mkangowo ngati akukadzula mwana wambuzi. Koma sanawuze abambo kapena amayi ake zimene anachitazo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenaka Samsoni anapita kukakambirana ndi mkaziyo, ndipo anamukonda mtsikanayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Patapita nthawi, Samsoni anabwerera kukatenga mtsikana uja. Panjira anapatuka kukaona mkango unawupha uja, ndipo anangoona njuchi zili mu mkangowo pamodzi ndi uchi wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono anakomberako uchi uja mʼmanja mwake ndi kumapita akudya. Atabwereranso kwa abambo ndi amayi ake, anawapatsako uchiwo ndipo anadya. Koma sanawawuze kuti uchi umenewo anawufula mu mkango wakufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsopano Samsoni anapita ku nyumba kwa mtsikanayo. Ndipo kumeneko Samsoni anakonza phwando monga ankachitira anyamata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makolo a mkwatibwiyo atamuona, anasankha anyamata makumi atatu kuti akhale naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samsoni anawawuza kuti, \"Bwanji ndikuphereni mwambi. Mukandiwuza tanthauzo lake asanathe masiku asanu ndi awiri aphwandowa, ndidzakupatsani zovala makumi atatu za bafuta ndi zina makumi atatu za tsiku la chikondwerero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma ngati simutha kundiwuza tanthauzo lake, inuyo mudzandipatsa zovala makumi atatu zabafuta ndi zina za tsiku la chikondwerero.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JDG 14:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iwo anamuyankha kuti, \"Tiwuze mwambi wakowo tiwumve.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JDG 14:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Chakudya chinatuluka mu chinthu chodya chinzake;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JDG 14:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo chozuna chinatuluka mu chinthu champhamvu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "JDG 14:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Panapita masiku atatu anthuwo akulephera kumasulira mwambiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsiku lachinayi anthuwo anawuza mkazi wa Samsoni kuti, \"Umunyengerere mwamuna wako kuti akuwuze tanthauzo la mwambiwu. Ngati sutero tikutentha iweyo pamodzi ndi nyumba ya abambo ako. Kodi unatiyitana kuti mudzatilande zinthu zathu?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenaka mkazi wa Samsoni anayamba kulira pamaso pake namuwuza kuti, \"Inu mumandida ndipo simundikonda. Mwaphera anyamata a mtundu wathu mwambi, koma ine wosandiwuza tanthauzo lake.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JDG 14:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni anamuyankha kuti, \"Taona sindinawuze abambo kapena amayi anga, ndiye ndiwuze iweyo?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkaziyo anamulirira masiku onse asanu ndi awiri aphwandowo. Choncho pa tsiku lachisanu ndi chiwiri anamuwuza tanthauzo lake popeza amamukakamiza. Ndipo mkaziyo anakawuza abale ake aja tanthauzo la mwambiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pambuyo pake anthu a mu mzinda aja anamuwuza Samsoni pa tsiku lachisanu ndi chiwiri dzuwa lisanalowe kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JDG 14:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Chozuna nʼchiyani choposa uchi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JDG 14:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Champhamvu nʼchiyani choposa mkango?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JDG 14:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni anawawuza kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JDG 14:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Mukanapanda kutipula ndi ngʼombe yanga yayingʼono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JDG 14:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "simukanatha kumasulira mwambi wangawu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Mzimu wa Yehova unafika pa iye mwamphamvu. Choncho anatsikira ku Asikeloni naphako anthu makumi atatu, natenga zovala zawo za tsiku la chikondwerero napereka kwa anthu amene anamasulira mwambi wake. Kenaka anabwerera ku nyumba ya abambo ake ndi mkwiyo waukulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo mkazi wa Samsoniyo anamukwatitsa kwa amene anali mnzake womuperekeza pa ukwati paja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JDG.15",
